WEBVTT

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.563
OBLIVIATE.

00:00:23.836 --> 00:00:26.012
Harry: HOW IS IT
THEY KNEW WE WERE THERE?

00:00:26.055 --> 00:00:28.101
Hermione: MAYBE YOU STILL HAVE
THE TRACE ON YOU?

00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:31.148
Ron: CAN'T BE. TRACE BREAKS
AT 17. IT'S WIZARDING LAW.

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:35.282
[ GASPS ]
WHAT?

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:38.633
WE DIDN'T CELEBRATE
YOUR BIRTHDAY, HARRY.

00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:41.854
GINNY AND I
[SIGHS] WE PREPARED A CAKE.

00:00:41.897 --> 00:00:44.117
WE WERE GOING TO BRING IT OUT
AT THE END OF WEDDING.

00:00:44.161 --> 00:00:46.337
LOOK, HERMIONE, HONESTLY,
I APPRECIATE THE THOUGHT,

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.862
BUT, REALLY, GIVEN THE FACT
THAT WE WERE ALMOST KILLED
BY A COUPLE OF DEATH EATERS

00:00:49.905 --> 00:00:52.473
A FEW MINUTES AGO...

00:00:52.517 --> 00:00:54.780
[ SIGHS ] RIGHT.

00:00:54.823 --> 00:00:56.825
[ SIGHS DEEPLY ]
PERSPECTIVE.

00:00:56.869 --> 00:01:00.133
WE NEED TO GET OFF THE STREETS,
GET SOMEWHERE SAFE.

00:01:01.874 --> 00:01:04.268
[ RUMBLING ]

00:01:07.445 --> 00:01:09.055
[ METAL CREAKING ]

00:01:26.942 --> 00:01:28.205
[ SCREAMS ]

00:01:32.296 --> 00:01:35.386
WHAT WAS THAT
ALL ABOUT?

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:38.302
[ SIGHS ]
PROBABLY MAD-EYE'S IDEA,

00:01:38.345 --> 00:01:41.348
CASE SNAPE
DECIDED TO COME SNOOPING.

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:43.263
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:01:43.307 --> 00:01:46.353
[ BANGING IN DISTANCE ]

00:01:49.617 --> 00:01:52.229
HOMENUM REVELIO.

00:01:58.147 --> 00:02:00.149
WE'RE ALONE.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.681
Ollivander:
NO, I BELIE-- I BELIEVED --
ANO-- ANOTHER WAND...

00:02:09.724 --> 00:02:12.379
IT D-DOESN'T MAKE SENSE...

00:02:12.423 --> 00:02:15.077
[ GRUNTING]

00:02:15.121 --> 00:02:18.211
I-I BELIEVED A DIFFERENT WAND
WOULD WORK. I SWEAR.

00:02:18.255 --> 00:02:21.214
THERE MUST BE ANOTHER WAY.

00:02:21.823 --> 00:02:24.609
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:02:35.359 --> 00:02:38.318
[ BANGING ]

00:03:10.655 --> 00:03:12.918
[ DOOR CREAKS ]

00:03:15.399 --> 00:03:17.444
[ SIGHS ]

00:03:29.978 --> 00:03:31.632
[ DOOR OPENS ]

00:03:31.676 --> 00:03:33.112
Ron:
[ In distance ] HARRY?

00:03:33.155 --> 00:03:35.549
HERMIONE, WHERE ARE YOU?

00:03:35.593 --> 00:03:39.248
I THINK
I'VE FOUND SOMETHING.

00:03:44.253 --> 00:03:45.777
LOVELY.

00:03:47.605 --> 00:03:51.130
[ DOOR CREAKS ]

00:03:51.173 --> 00:03:55.003
"REGULUS ARCTURUS BLACK."

00:03:55.047 --> 00:03:56.831
R.A.B.

00:04:00.052 --> 00:04:03.795
Harry: "I KNOW I WILL BE DEAD
LONG BEFORE YOU READ THIS.

00:04:03.838 --> 00:04:07.451
I HAVE STOLEN THE REAL HORCRUX
AND INTEND TO DESTROY IT."

00:04:07.494 --> 00:04:11.150
R.A.B.
IS SIRIUS' BROTHER.

00:04:11.193 --> 00:04:12.412
YES.

00:04:14.588 --> 00:04:18.157
QUESTION IS, DID HE ACTUALLY
DESTROY THE REALHORCRUX?

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.247
[ BANGING, CLATTERING ]

00:04:37.959 --> 00:04:40.266
[ KREACHER
GRUNTING AND GROANING ]

00:04:40.309 --> 00:04:42.790
YOU'VE BEEN SPYING ON US,
HAVE YOU?
OI!

00:04:42.834 --> 00:04:47.142
KREACHER HAS BEEN...
WATCHING.

00:04:47.186 --> 00:04:49.493
Hermione: MAYBE HE KNOWS
WHERE THE REALLOCKET IS.

00:04:51.582 --> 00:04:54.454
YOU EVER
SEEN THIS BEFORE?[ GASPS ]

00:04:54.498 --> 00:04:56.282
KREACHER?

00:04:56.325 --> 00:04:59.590
UH, UH,
IT'S MASTER REGULUS' LOCKET.

00:04:59.633 --> 00:05:02.419
BUT THERE WERE TWO,
WEREN'T THERE?

00:05:02.462 --> 00:05:05.117
WHERE'S THE OTHER ONE?

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:07.641
[ GROANS ]

00:05:07.685 --> 00:05:11.036
KREACHER DOESN'T KNOW
WHERE THE OTHER LOCKET IS.

00:05:11.079 --> 00:05:13.212
YES, BUT DID
YOU EVER SEE IT?

00:05:13.255 --> 00:05:14.735
WAS IT
IN THIS HOUSE?

00:05:14.779 --> 00:05:16.868
YOU FILTHY MUDBLOOD!
DEATH EATERS ARE COMING --

00:05:16.911 --> 00:05:19.218
RON!
AH, BLOOD TRAITOR,
WEASLEY.

00:05:19.261 --> 00:05:21.176
ANSWER HER.

00:05:22.526 --> 00:05:25.311
YES.

00:05:25.354 --> 00:05:27.400
IT WAS HERE...

00:05:27.444 --> 00:05:29.489
IN THIS HOUSE.

00:05:29.533 --> 00:05:32.492
A MOST EVIL OBJECT.

00:05:32.536 --> 00:05:34.494
HOW DO YOU MEAN?

00:05:34.538 --> 00:05:37.236
[ SIGHS ] BEFORE
MASTER REGULUS DIED,

00:05:37.279 --> 00:05:39.804
HE ORDERED KREACHER
TO DESTROY IT,

00:05:39.847 --> 00:05:42.807
BUT NO MATTER HOW HARD
KREACHER TRIED,

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.330
HE COULD NOT DO IT.

00:05:44.373 --> 00:05:46.724
WELL, WHERE IS IT NOW?

00:05:46.767 --> 00:05:48.595
DID SOMEONE TAKE IT?

00:05:48.639 --> 00:05:51.990
HE CAME IN THE NIGHT.

00:05:52.033 --> 00:05:54.383
HE TOOK MANY THINGS,

00:05:54.427 --> 00:05:56.821
INCLUDING THE LOCKET.

00:05:56.864 --> 00:05:58.213
WHO DID?

00:05:58.257 --> 00:06:00.085
WHO WAS IT, KREACHER?

00:06:00.128 --> 00:06:02.827
[ SIGHS ]

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:05.873
MUNDUNGUS.

00:06:05.917 --> 00:06:09.660
MUNDUNGUS FLETCHER.

00:06:09.703 --> 00:06:12.314
FIND HIM.

